//yura-store.npc

*E_NAME			"Lauren store"

*E_CHAT			"Having enough potions before        hunting is standard preparation."
*E_CHAT			"We are a little far from a big town but we have everything you need."
*E_CHAT			"It's so cold today, you may rest    here for a while and before leaving."
*E_CHAT			"Potions can freeze in cold weather, but they're just as effective."